  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 500, padding: 54, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>观察到的结果，不等于可靠证据</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>这个分数，到底有多少证据值得相信？</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>当证据缺失、冲突或可信度不一，如何避免把观察值直接当成可信结论？</Text>
    <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Score Stability ≠ Evidence Support Stability</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>分数稳定，不等于证据支撑稳定</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>一句话：我们在补的不是一个更高的分数，而是「这个分数有多少证据值得相信」。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>起名困难队　　汇报人：张镇源</Text>
